    "html": "<b>1. Install Patch</b><br>Installs the 1850 start-year patch and updates TF3 Early Start Compatibility.<br><br><b>2. Start Game</b><br>Launch Transport Fever 3.<br><br><b>3. Activate Compatibility Mod</b><br>Enable <b>TF3 Early Start Compatibility</b> for every game or preset that uses Early Start.<br><br><b>Real dates, whenever possible</b><br>Every mod author can use real historical availability years. Vehicles already configured for Era A remain untouched and are naturally available in an 1850 game. Use <b>Advanced Mode</b> when individual vehicles, constructions or mods need adjustment."
